OL,3,GNEWSAParton road sign turned into Dolly
OL,4,Atribute
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road sign pointing to a village
OL,7,Fsharing Dolly Parton's surname has been
OL,8,Fturned into a tribute with the addition
OL,9,Fof some aptly-placed orange stickers.
OL,11,FFans and celebrities around the world
OL,12,Fhave been paying tribute to the singer,
OL,13,Factress and businesswoman, who died
OL,14,Ffrom cancer aged 80 earlier this week.
OL,16,FA road sign on the A595 at the Rosehill
OL,17,FRoad junction in Cumbria, showing the
OL,18,Fway to Whitehaven, Barrow and Parton,
OL,19,Fhad "Dolly" added before Parton and
OL,20,F"RIP" afterwards.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
